  "definition": "Koro is an acute delusional syndrome most often described in Malay and Southern Chinese cultures, in which a person suddenly feels depersonalized and believes the penis is shrinking into the abdomen and that death will follow. It is generally considered a culture-specific syndrome, though it has also been described outside Asian populations.",
